          "y": 0,
          "width": 400,
          "height": 130
        },
        {
          "id": "8e7f19a29c90e76d",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Color it**\nCyan: the agent carries it to done. Purple: one step (a brief, then a plan), then it hands back. Color hotkeys: Settings > Kanvas board > Hotkeys.",
