          "y": 160,
          "width": 400,
          "height": 130
        },
        {
          "id": "2994a1d1f241b6a0",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Run a pass**\nCommand \"Kanvas board: Run pass\". A terminal opens with the agent on this board; it turns the cards it takes orange.",
