          "y": 320,
          "width": 400,
          "height": 130
        },
        {
          "id": "4cc71bb01534a8d8",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Answer**\nYellow: a question or a review for you, in the card's note. Answer there, color the card cyan or purple again, run the next pass.",
